<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
<title>Milin — Websites for Local Business</title>
<meta name="description" content="Modern business websites built in 48 hours. See live examples.">
<style>
  :root{
    --bg:#0b0f14; --card:#141b24; --line:#1f2a36;
    --tx:#eaf0f7; --dim:#93a4b8; --acc:#38bdf8; --ok:#34d399;
  }
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: light){
    :root{ --bg:#f6f8fb; --card:#fff; --line:#e3e9f0; --tx:#0d1520; --dim:#5b6c80; --acc:#0284c7; --ok:#059669; }
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent}
  body{
    background:var(--bg);color:var(--tx);
    font:16px/1.5 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",Roboto,sans-serif;
    padding:20px 16px 48px;max-width:640px;margin:0 auto;
  }
  header{padding:8px 0 24px}
  .tag{
    display:inline-block;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--acc);font-weight:700;margin-bottom:10px;
  }
  h1{font-size:27px;line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-.02em;margin-bottom:10px}
  .sub{color:var(--dim);font-size:15px}
  .strip{
    display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:18px 0 26px;
  }
  .chip{
    background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:999px;
    padding:7px 13px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:var(--dim);
  }
  .chip b{color:var(--ok)}
  h2{
    font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--dim);
    margin:28px 0 12px;font-weight:700;
  }
  a.item{
    display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;text-decoration:none;color:inherit;
    background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;
    padding:15px 16px;margin-bottom:10px;transition:border-color .15s,transform .1s;
  }
  a.item:active{transform:scale(.985)}
  a.item:hover{border-color:var(--acc)}
  .ico{
    flex:0 0 46px;height:46px;border-radius:11px;display:grid;place-items:center;
    font-size:21px;background:rgba(56,189,248,.1);border:1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .meta{flex:1;min-width:0}
  .nm{font-weight:650;font-size:16px;margin-bottom:2px}
  .ds{font-size:13px;color:var(--dim);overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap}
  .go{color:var(--dim);font-size:19px;flex:0 0 auto}
  .price{
    background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;
    padding:18px;margin-top:10px;
  }
  .row{
    display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;
    padding:11px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .row:last-child{border-bottom:0}
  .row .l{font-size:14px}
  .row .l small{display:block;color:var(--dim);font-size:12px;margin-top:2px}
  .row .r{font-weight:700;font-size:16px;white-space:nowrap;padding-left:14px}
  .best{color:var(--ok)}
  footer{
    margin-top:30px;padding:18px;background:var(--card);
    border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;text-align:center;
  }
  footer .big{font-size:17px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:5px}
  footer .sm{font-size:13px;color:var(--dim)}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <div class="tag">Web Design</div>
  <h1>Modern websites for local business.</h1>
  <p class="sub">Live in 48 hours. Built for phones first — because that's where your customers are.</p>
  <div class="strip">
    <span class="chip"><b>48h</b> delivery</span>
    <span class="chip"><b>100%</b> mobile</span>
    <span class="chip">Free demo first</span>
  </div>
</header>

<h2>Live examples — tap to open</h2>

<a class="item" href="https://milin555.github.io/Dr.neo/">
  <div class="ico">🦷</div>
  <div class="meta">
    <div class="nm">Lura Dental</div>
    <div class="ds">Clinic site — booking, services, team</div>
  </div>
  <div class="go">›</div>
</a>

<a class="item" href="https://milin555.github.io/modernsmilecenter/">
  <div class="ico">✨</div>
  <div class="meta">
    <div class="nm">Modern Smile Center</div>
    <div class="ds">Cosmetic clinic — gallery, treatments</div>
  </div>
  <div class="go">›</div>
</a>

<a class="item" href="https://milin555.github.io/ritterandramsey/">
  <div class="ico">🏥</div>
  <div class="meta">
    <div class="nm">Ritter &amp; Ramsey</div>
    <div class="ds">Multi-doctor practice — full site</div>
  </div>
  <div class="go">›</div>
</a>

<a class="item" href="https://milin555.github.io/Gary-S.-Solnit-DDS-MS/">
  <div class="ico">💎</div>
  <div class="meta">
    <div class="nm">Gary Solnit DDS</div>
    <div class="ds">Premium clinic — luxury layout</div>
  </div>
  <div class="go">›</div>
</a>

<a class="item" href="https://milin555.github.io/saidharanx-catalogue/">
  <div class="ico">🛍️</div>
  <div class="meta">
    <div class="nm">Product Catalogue</div>
    <div class="ds">Online shop — products, cart</div>
  </div>
  <div class="go">›</div>
</a>

<a class="item" href="https://milin555.github.io/Dr.-Jim-Arnold/">
  <div class="ico">🎯</div>
  <div class="meta">
    <div class="nm">Coaching Hub</div>
    <div class="ds">Personal brand — courses, bookings</div>
  </div>
  <div class="go">›</div>
</a>

<a class="item" href="https://milin555.github.io/dr-ritter-academy/">
  <div class="ico">🎓</div>
  <div class="meta">
    <div class="nm">Online Academy</div>
    <div class="ds">Course platform — video, members</div>
  </div>
  <div class="go">›</div>
</a>

<h2>Pricing</h2>
<div class="price">
  <div class="row">
    <div class="l">Express<small>3 pages · 48 hours</small></div>
    <div class="r">₹15,000</div>
  </div>
  <div class="row">
    <div class="l">Business<small>6 pages · gallery · enquiry form</small></div>
    <div class="r best">₹25,000</div>
  </div>
  <div class="row">
    <div class="l">Premium<small>10 pages · online shop</small></div>
    <div class="r">₹40,000</div>
  </div>
  <div class="row">
    <div class="l">Care plan<small>hosting · edits · backups</small></div>
    <div class="r">₹2,000/mo</div>
  </div>
</div>

<footer>
  <div class="big">Free demo before you pay</div>
  <div class="sm">I build your site first. You only pay if you like it.</div>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
